-- DB update 2026_09_10_08 -> 2026_09_10_09
-- Arcane Mage rework (docs/arcane-mage-rework-design.md) - Phase 3, Batch D (final batch).
-- .claude/skills/class-rework/SKILL.md Phase 3: Netherwind Presence (9,1), Temporal Convergence
-- (8,1), and Arcane Overload (10,1) - the last 3 items on the "Deferred to Phase 3" list. See the
-- plan at the time: ~/.claude/plans/twinkling-strolling-lagoon.md.
--
-- Data half:
--   Netherwind Presence (44400/44402/44403): effect1 replaced from a flat always-on haste% aura
--     (a Phase 2 shell) to a pure SPELL_AURA_DUMMY proc-scaffold marker (native ProcTypeMask 65536/
--     ProcChance 100/ProcCharges 0). The real timed/stacking haste buff moves to 3 new rank spells
--     (200088-200090, CumulativeAura 3 - native stacking handles "up to 3 times"). Capstone marker
--     added to rank 3 (44403) only, new effect2. New ICD marker (200091, hidden) and capstone speed
--     buff (200094, +50% move speed/5s).
--   Temporal Convergence (200078, Phase 2 shell): no data change this batch, pure C++.
--   Arcane Overload (200079, Phase 2 shell): new effect2, AoE-around-caster (10yd) for "nearby
--     enemies" - a simplification from "around the target," flagged for Phase 4 playtest. New
--     damage sub-spell (200092, real SPELL_EFFECT_SCHOOL_DAMAGE so it rolls crit/Versatility
--     normally) and 15s follow-up buff (200093, mana-regen tick + flat +10% spell damage).
--
-- C++ half (src/server/scripts/Spells/spell_mage.cpp) ships alongside this migration, not through
-- generate.py - see that diff. Notable: Temporal Convergence's cooldown reduction reuses
-- Player::ApplyCooldownHasteCorrection (clear-then-reset) rather than ModifySpellCooldown's delta
-- approach, which the user's own prior investigation (Player.cpp, 2026-08-31) confirmed has no
-- client-side effect on this client. Netherwind Presence's capstone (on Slow) uses a hidden-aura
-- ICD instead of a member-variable timer, since that SpellScript instance is recreated fresh per
-- cast (unlike an AuraScript hosted on a permanently-known passive). Per the user's clarification
-- (2026-09-08): only Arcane Barrage and Temporal Convergence drop Arcane Blast stacks - Arcane
-- Overload does not, so its script only reads Arcane Resonance's existing stack bonus like any
-- other Arcane spell, no stack-drop logic needed.
--
-- This is the last Phase 3 batch - every item on the "Deferred to Phase 3" list is now shipped or
-- explicitly dropped from scope (Spellblade's capstone). Remaining work is Phase 4 (playtest guide).
--
-- generate.py clean (zero lint WARNINGs). codestyle-cpp.py clean. test_sql_dump.py + manual
-- balanced-statement scan clean - codestyle-sql.py itself can't run in this sandbox (no network for
-- git fetch), same accepted limitation as every prior batch.

DELETE FROM `spell_dbc` WHERE `ID` IN (44400, 44402, 44403, 200079, 200088, 200089, 200090, 200091, 200092, 200093, 200094);
